{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   Implement 10 SOS Magic: The Gathering card implementations in `/workspace/cards/sos/`: cards 1, 4, 13, 57, 97, 120, 201, 226, 245, 257. Each card directory (`cards/sos/sos_<N>/`) contains a `card_spec.json` (metadata) and a `card_impl.py` template (stub class) to fill in. Use completed FDN cards in `/workspace/cards/fdn/` as examples, refer to `RULEBOOK.txt` for rules, and read engine source modules (`engine/card.py`, `engine/events.py`, `engine/triggers.py`, `engine/replacement_effects.py`, `engine/zones.py`) for API discovery. The user explicitly states: \"You are expected to make changes to the engine to implement new keywords and mechanics. The existing code base may not be perfect, you are free to make changes that don't break current behavior.\"\n\n   CRITICAL CONSTRAINT (verbatim): \"Do not modify any files under workspace/engine_tests/. These tests are staged for your local verification only; the runner uses its own authoritative copies for grading. Modifying the workspace tests will not change your score — it will only mislead you about whether your engine changes are correct.\"\n\n   Per-card tests go at `cards/sos/sos_<N>/tests.py` (I create these). Do NOT modify FDN tests (`cards/fdn/fdn_*/tests.py`). Engine modifications must be additive/behavior-preserving (may add/modify bodies; must NOT rename/move/delete existing engine items, must keep engine_tests green).\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - MTG mechanics to implement: Casualty (Silverquill), Counter+conditional-delayed-mana (Mana Sculpt), Converge (Together as One), graveyard-cost-reduction + attack-trigger cast-from-graveyard-with-exile-replacement (Dawning Archaic), Affinity-for-creatures self + granting it to your instants/sorceries (Witherbloom), land mana abilities + {5} becomes-creature (Great Hall), Prepared/MDFC token-maker + cast-copy (Emeritus // Swords to Plowshares), Paradigm/exile-and-cast-from-library (Improvisation Capstone), Miracle granter + opponent-upkeep loot (Lorehold), Planeswalker with Surveil/discard/reanimate/coin-flip-skip-turns (Ral Zarek).\n   - Engine architecture: event-driven TriggerManager (condition `(game,event)->bool`; effect `(game)->None` — effect does NOT receive event, must capture via closure or stash on source); ReplacementManager (\"instead\", applied inline, only when leaving battlefield); 7-layer EffectManager (Layer enum 1-7, SubLayer 7a-7d, ContinuousEffect.duration: DURATION_PERMANENT=-1, DURATION_END_OF_TURN=0, or turn-number); LIFO Stack + priority_loop; state-based actions; APNAP trigger ordering (active player's triggers pushed first→bottom; non-active on top→resolve first).\n   - Loyalty system: `engine/card.py` LoyaltyAbility(loyalty_cost, effect, description); `engine/abilities.py` LoyaltyAbilityInstance + activate_ability (sorcery-speed + once-per-turn via `_loyalty_activated_this_turn` set, `clear_loyalty_tracking()`). Cards expose `get_loyalty_abilities()`; targeted loyalty effects read `pw._resolve_target`; emblems made via `type('Emblem', (), {'name': ...})()`.\n   - Testing: DeterministicPlayer scripted via `_script` deque (popleft) for choose/choose_target/choose_yes_no/choose_card/assign_damage_order; test_utils helpers script via `player._script.appendleft`.\n   - Python: dataclasses, Flag enum Keyword, frozen ManaCost/HybridManaSymbol.\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n   - `/workspace/run_manifest.json` — card_filter [1,4,13,57,97,120,201,226,245,257], benchmark_set \"sos\". Harness-owned.\n   - `/workspace/PROJECT_MAP.md` — FDN cards shipping tests.py: fdn_13, fdn_142, fdn_205, fdn_215, fdn_244. Bare package imports. Card paths.\n   - **All 10 SOS oracle texts (verbatim, authoritative):**\n     - sos_1 The Dawning Archaic {10} Legendary Creature—Avatar 7/7 Reach: \"This spell costs {1} less to cast for each instant and sorcery card in your graveyard.\\nReach\\nWhenever The Dawning Archaic attacks, you may cast target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard without paying its mana cost. If that spell would be put into your graveyard, exile it instead.\"\n     - sos_4 Together as One {6} Sorcery: \"Converge — Target player draws X cards, Together as One deals X damage to any target, and you gain X life, where X is the number of colors of mana spent to cast this spell.\"\n     - sos_13 Emeritus of Truce // Swords to Plowshares {1}{W}{W} // {W}, Creature—Cat Cleric // Instant, 3/3, Prepared: \"When this creature enters, target player creates a 1/1 white and black Inkling creature token with flying. Then if an opponent controls more creatures than you, this creature becomes prepared. (While it's prepared, you may cast a copy of its spell. Doing so unprepares it.)\"\n     - sos_57 Mana Sculpt {1}{U}{U} Instant: \"Counter target spell. If you control a Wizard, add an amount of {C} equal to the amount of mana spent to cast that spell at the beginning of your next main phase.\"\n     - sos_97 Ral Zarek, Guest Lecturer {1}{B}{B} Legendary Planeswalker—Ral, loyalty 3, Surveil: \"+1: Surveil 2.\\n−1: Any number of target players each discard a card.\\n−2: Return target creature card with mana value 3 or less from your graveyard to the battlefield.\\n−7: Flip five coins. Target opponent skips their next X turns, where X is the number of coins that came up heads.\"\n     - sos_120 Improvisation Capstone {5}{R}{R} Sorcery—Lesson, Paradigm: \"Exile cards from the top of your library until you exile cards with total mana value 4 or greater. You may cast any number of spells from among them without paying their mana costs.\\nParadigm (Then exile this spell. After you first resolve a spell with this name, you may cast a copy of it from exile without paying its mana cost at the beginning of each of your first main phases.)\"\n     - sos_201 Lorehold, the Historian {3}{R}{W} Legendary Creature—Elder Dragon 5/5 Flying+Haste: \"Flying, haste\\nEach instant and sorcery card in your hand has miracle {2}. (You may cast a card for its miracle cost when you draw it if it's the first card you drew this turn.)\\nAt the beginning of each opponent's upkeep, you may discard a card. If you do, draw a card.\"\n     - sos_226 Silverquill, the Disputant {2}{W}{B} Legendary Creature—Elder Dragon 4/4 Flying+Vigilance: \"Flying, vigilance\\nEach instant and sorcery spell you cast has casualty 1. (As you cast that spell, you may sacrifice a creature with power 1 or greater. When you do, copy the spell and you may choose new targets for the copy.)\"\n     - sos_245 Witherbloom, the Balancer {6}{B}{G} Legendary Creature—Elder Dragon 5/5 Flying+Deathtouch+Affinity: \"Affinity for creatures (This spell costs {1} less to cast for each creature you control.)\\nFlying, deathtouch\\nInstant and sorcery spells you cast have affinity for creatures.\"\n     - sos_257 Great Hall of the Biblioplex, Land (empty mana_cost): \"{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}, Pay 1 life: Add one mana of any color. Spend this mana only to cast an instant or sorcery spell.\\n{5}: If this land isn't a creature, it becomes a 2/4 Wizard creature with \\\"Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, this creature gets +1/+0 until end of turn.\\\" It's still a land.\"\n   - `/workspace/cards/stubs/sos_stubs.py` (8820 lines; read 1-1285) — authoritative stub class signatures. Confirmed: `TheDawningArchaic(Creature)` {10} Avatar Legendary 7/7; `TogetherAsOne(Sorcery)` {6}; `EmeritusOfTruceSwordsToPlowshares(Creature)` {1}{W}{W} Cat Cleric 3/3; `ManaSculpt(Instant)` {1}{U}{U}; `RalZarekGuestLecturer(Planeswalker)` {1}{B}{B} subtypes {'Ral'} Legendary starting_loyalty 3. Each stub sets `self.colors=[...]` after super().__init__ (FDN refs omit colors). Remaining 5 classes (ImprovisationCapstone, LoreholdTheHistorian, SilverquillTheDisputant, WitherbloomTheBalancer, GreatHallOfTheBiblioplex) are beyond line 1285 but their static props are known from specs + prior summary.\n   - All 10 `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_<N>/card_impl.py` — currently stub `class XxxYyy(CardImpl): pass` (sos_226 confirmed `class SilverquillTheDisputant(CardImpl): pass`). Class names confirmed: TheDawningArchaic, TogetherAsOne, EmeritusOfTruceSwordsToPlowshares, ManaSculpt, RalZarekGuestLecturer, ImprovisationCapstone, LoreholdTheHistorian, SilverquillTheDisputant, WitherbloomTheBalancer, GreatHallOfTheBiblioplex.\n   - `/workspace/engine/casting.py` — `cast_spell(game,player,card)`: 8-step pipeline; sets `card.colors_spent = list(player.mana_pool.last_payment_colors)` after pay; calls on_cast; pushes StackObject with `_on_resolve`→`_resolve_spell`. Does NOT fire SpellCastTriggeredEvent. `cast_spell_free(game,player,card,from_zone)` similar, no mana/timing. `_resolve_spell`: sets `card.chosen_targets=stack_obj.targets`, calls on_resolve, then permanents→`move_to_zone(...STACK,BATTLEFIELD)` else→`move_to_zone(...STACK,GRAVEYARD)` (no replacement_event, no exile flag yet). `get_cost_reduction` only calls `card.cost_reduction(game)`, clamps to generic. Planned edit: add SpellCastTriggeredEvent firing after push; add `_exile_on_graveyard` flag in `_resolve_spell` else-branch.\n   - `/workspace/engine/stack.py` — StackObject(source, controller, targets=[], on_resolve, is_mana_ability). `copy_spell(game, original, controller, new_targets=None)` shallow-copies source card, on_resolve calls copied_card.on_resolve directly (no zone move) — used for Silverquill casualty and prepared/paradigm copies.\n   - `/workspace/engine/events.py` — SpellCastTriggeredEvent(spell, player, card, controller) and AttacksTriggeredEvent(creature, attacker) DEFINED but NEVER FIRED. MoveToGraveyardReplacementEvent(destination, controller, owner, prevented; card property→None) + subclasses CreatureDiesReplacementEvent(creature), PermanentDestroyedReplacementEvent(permanent), SacrificeReplacementEvent(permanent). BeginningOfUpkeepTriggeredEvent() (no fields). No BeginningOfMainPhase event exists (would need to add for Mana Sculpt/Improvisation).\n   - `/workspace/engine/triggers.py` — fire_event collects by isinstance + condition, pushes StackObject(source=trigger.source, controller=trigger.controller, on_resolve=trigger.effect) APNAP-ordered. Effect receives only game.\n   - `/workspace/engine/card.py` — full hierarchy. CardImpl hooks: can_cast, cost_reduction, on_cast, on_resolve, get_targets, register_triggers, register_replacement_effects, get_activated_abilities, get_modes. Creature has base_power/base_toughness/modified_*/power/toughness props/plus_one_counters/minus_one_counters/summoning_sick/is_attacking; `_reset_characteristics` resets to base. Land.can_cast→False, get_mana_abilities. Planeswalker(starting_loyalty)→loyalty, get_loyalty_abilities. Dataclasses: Mode, ActivatedAbility, LoyaltyAbility, ManaAbility, ContinuousEffect.\n   - `/workspace/engine/combat.py` — `declare_attackers_step`: eligible=creatures with base_power and `_can_attack`; `active.choose(eligible,\"declare attackers\")`; sets attacker.is_attacking=True, taps unless VIGILANCE. Does NOT fire AttacksTriggeredEvent (planned: fire per-attacker setting both attacker & creature). `_can_attack`/`_can_block`/`_deal_damage` helpers.\n   - `/workspace/engine/game.py` — helpers: create_token (is_token=True, add to bf, fire ETB, then register), destroy/sacrifice (move_to_zone w/ replacement events), exile (finds zone, move_to_zone to EXILE), draw_card (tracks cards_drawn_this_turn, fires DrawsCardTriggeredEvent), discard (move HAND→GRAVEYARD), add_counter/remove_counter (\"+1/+1\",\"-1/-1\",\"loyalty\", else generic dict), tap/untap, run_game.\n   - `/workspace/engine/zones.py` — `move_to_zone(game,card,from_zone,to_zone,*,replacement_event=None)`: replacement applied ONLY `if replacement_event is not None and leaving_battlefield`. move_zone deletes obj.colors_spent on zone change. _DESTINATION_ZONE_MAP {\"graveyard\",\"exile\",\"hand\",\"library\"}. Fires Leaves/CreatureDies/Enters events; registers/unregisters triggers+replacements.\n   - `/workspace/engine/mana.py` — ManaPool; `last_payment_colors` = sorted distinct non-colorless Colors of last pay(). `pay(cost, choices=None)`. No mana-amount-spent tracking (Mana Sculpt needs `card.mana_cost.cmc` or a new attribute).\n   - `/workspace/engine/turn.py` — run_turn iterates phases; fires `BeginningOfUpkeepTriggeredEvent()` at (BEGINNING,UPKEEP); _do_combat_step dispatches; _do_untap_step clears summoning_sick + land_plays_remaining=1; _do_cleanup_step. NO main-phase event fired.\n   - `/workspace/engine/game_state.py` — _TURN_SEQUENCE (12 entries); advance_phase empties mana pools each transition, at end-of-turn increments turn_number, pops extra_turns FIFO else uses _normal_next_index. extra_turns = FIFO list of seat indices (models EXTRA turns; \"skip turns\" is inverse, not directly supported).\n   - `/workspace/engine/types.py` — Color, ManaType(+COLORLESS), Zone, Phase, Step, CardType, Supertype, Keyword(Flag incl FLYING,VIGILANCE,DEATHTOUCH,HASTE,REACH,FLASH,PROWESS,etc), HybridManaSymbol, ManaCost (generic/pips/x_count/hybrid; .cmc; .parse), TargetRequirement(filter_fn, description, zone).\n   - `/workspace/engine/player.py` — DeterministicPlayer._pop() popleft from _script deque; choose/choose_target/choose_yes_no/choose_card/assign_damage_order all pop one.\n   - `/workspace/engine/replacement_effects.py` — ReplacementEffect(event_type, source, condition, replacement, controller); ReplacementManager.apply runs matching replacements (player chooses order if multiple), each once.\n   - `/workspace/engine/continuous_effects.py` — Layer/SubLayer enums, ContinuousEffect, EffectManager.add (auto-timestamp)/remove_expired/apply_all (calls _reset_characteristics on bf objects then applies sorted effects).\n   - `/workspace/engine/abilities.py` — activate_ability dispatches to LoyaltyAbilityInstance (sorcery-speed, once-per-turn, adjusts loyalty, push to stack) or ActivatedAbilityInstance (mana→immediate else push). tap_cost helper. clear_loyalty_tracking.\n   - `/workspace/test_utils.py` — create_game(deck1,deck2,*,scripts=(s1,s2),life...); set_board_state(game,idx,*,battlefield/hand/graveyard/life/mana); cast_spell(game,idx,name,targets) scripts targets via appendleft then engine cast then `_resolve_top_of_stack` (pops+on_resolve+SBAs until empty); advance_to_phase (calls game.advance_phase directly — does NOT fire turn events); declare_attackers(game,names) appendlefts attacker list, sets in_combat, calls declare_attackers_step; declare_blockers(game,{atk:[blk]}). card_colors(card) derives from mana cost pips/hybrid.\n   - **FDN references read:**\n     - fdn_205 WardensOfTheCycle (converge): `self.colors_spent: int = 0`; on_resolve uses `count = self.colors_spent` to create that many tokens. (Tests set int; cast pipeline sets list — handle both.)\n     - fdn_44 KaitoCunningInfiltrator (planeswalker): register_triggers for passive (DealsDamageTriggeredEvent, condition reads event.source/target/event.combat); get_loyalty_abilities returns [LoyaltyAbility(loyalty_cost=+1/−2/−9, effect=_fn, description=...)]; uses `getattr(pw,'_resolve_target',None)`; emblem via `type('Emblem',(),{'name':...})()` registering SpellCastTriggeredEvent trigger.\n     - fdn_45 KioraTheRisingTide (attack trigger): condition `attacker = event.attacker or event.creature; if attacker is not source: return False; ...`; effect `(game)->None` captures source, uses choose_yes_no + create_token.\n     - fdn_13 FleetingFlight (targeting): get_targets returns [TargetRequirement(filter_fn, description, zone=BATTLEFIELD)]; on_resolve reads `getattr(self,\"chosen_targets\",None)` falling back to `_resolve_target`; uses add_counter + ContinuousEffect (Layer.ABILITY, DURATION_END_OF_TURN) for temporary flying; comment shows \"ENGINE LIMITATION\" pattern for unsupported effects. tests.py uses create_game(), constructs spell, sets spell.chosen_targets directly, asserts properties.\n   - **engine_tests verified (must stay green):** test_triggers.py imports SpellCastTriggeredEvent + AttacksTriggeredEvent but only uses them in manual `_make_trigger` calls — never fires them via engine; `test_no_registered_triggers_pushes_nothing` confirms firing with nothing registered is a no-op. test_extra_turns.py manipulates game.extra_turns directly (FIFO of seat indices) and calls advance_phase via `_end_turn`.\n\n4. Errors and fixes:\n   None — no code was written or executed this session. Pre-existing converge type inconsistency noted (fdn_205 uses int colors_spent; cast pipeline sets a list) — to be handled defensively (e.g., `len()` on list or use int directly).\n\n5. Problem Solving:\n   - Confirmed SpellCastTriggeredEvent + AttacksTriggeredEvent are never fired by the engine; verified via test_triggers.py that firing them is safe (no-op when nothing registered). Safe to add firing.\n   - Designed Silverquill casualty: Silverquill's `register_triggers` registers a SpellCastTriggeredEvent trigger whose condition (a) checks the cast card is an instant/sorcery controlled by Silverquill's controller and (b) stashes `event.spell` (the StackObject) on `self` for the effect to read; the effect optionally sacrifices a creature with power ≥1 (choose_yes_no + choose which) then `copy_spell(...)` and pushes the copy. This requires firing SpellCastTriggeredEvent in cast_spell after push so the trigger goes on the stack above the original spell (copy resolves first).\n   - Designed \"exile instead of graveyard\" (Dawning Archaic) via a `_exile_on_graveyard` flag read in `_resolve_spell` else-branch (since _resolve_spell's stack→graveyard move isn't a battlefield-leave, replacement events won't fire there).\n   - Open challenge: \"beginning of your next main phase\" (Mana Sculpt) and \"each of your first main phases\" (Improvisation paradigm) have n