{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   Implement 10 SOS Magic: The Gathering card implementations in `/workspace/cards/sos/`: cards 1, 4, 13, 57, 97, 120, 201, 226, 245, 257. Each card directory (`cards/sos/sos_<N>/`) contains a `card_spec.json` (metadata) and a `card_impl.py` template (stub class) to fill in. Use completed FDN cards in `/workspace/cards/fdn/` as examples, refer to `RULEBOOK.txt`, and read engine source modules for API discovery (`engine/card.py`, `engine/events.py`, `engine/triggers.py`, `engine/replacement_effects.py`, `engine/zones.py`). The user states: \"You are expected to make changes to the engine to implement new keywords and mechanics. The existing code base may not be perfect, you are free to make changes that don't break current behavior.\"\n\n   CRITICAL CONSTRAINT (verbatim): \"Do not modify any files under workspace/engine_tests/. These tests are staged for your local verification only; the runner uses its own authoritative copies for grading. Modifying the workspace tests will not change your score — it will only mislead you about whether your engine changes are correct.\"\n\n   Per-card tests go at `cards/sos/sos_<N>/tests.py` (I create these). Do NOT modify FDN tests. Engine modifications must be additive/behavior-preserving (engine_tests baseline = 1145 passed, confirmed; the prior summary's \"1184\" was inaccurate).\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - MTG mechanics: Casualty (sos_226 ✓), Counter+conditional-delayed-mana (sos_57 ✓), Converge (sos_4 ✓), graveyard-cost-reduction + attack-trigger cast-from-graveyard-with-exile-replacement (sos_1 ✓), Affinity for creatures self + granting to instants/sorceries (sos_245 ✓), land mana abilities + {5}-becomes-creature animation (sos_257 in progress), Prepared/MDFC token-maker + cast-copy (sos_13), Paradigm/exile-and-cast-from-library (sos_120), Miracle granter + opponent-upkeep loot (sos_201), Planeswalker Surveil/discard/reanimate/coin-flip-skip-turns (sos_97).\n   - Engine: event-driven TriggerManager (condition `(game,event)->bool`; effect `(game)->None` receives ONLY game, must capture via closure; `isinstance(event,event_type)` filters BEFORE condition; APNAP ordering; fire_event pushes matching triggers as StackObjects with on_resolve=effect; unregister by source identity). ReplacementManager. 7-layer EffectManager (ContinuousEffect with source/layer/sublayer/apply/duration). LIFO Stack (push/pop/peek/remove/objects/is_empty). DeterministicPlayer scripted via `_script` deque (popleft); choose/choose_yes_no/choose_target/choose_card all just `_pop()`.\n   - ManaAbility: `cost(game, source)->bool` (taps, returns success), `mana_produced(game)->None` (adds to source.controller.mana_pool). ActivatedAbility: `cost(game,source)->bool`, `effect(game)->None`. Mana abilities resolve immediately; others push to stack. `get_mana_abilities()` and `get_activated_abilities()` on cards.\n   - Creature: power/toughness are properties = `modified_power + plus_one_counters - minus_one_counters`; needs base_power/base_toughness/modified_power/modified_toughness/summoning_sick etc. Land class lacks these.\n   - Python 3.11.2; run with `pytest` directly (NOT `python`). pytest.ini \"Unknown config option: timeout\" warning is harmless.\n   - All 10 oracle texts + class names (authoritative): sos_1 `TheDawningArchaic` {10}; sos_4 `TogetherAsOne` {6}; sos_13 `EmeritusOfTruceSwordsToPlowshares` {1}{W}{W}//{W} Cat Cleric//Instant 3/3 Prepared (\"When this creature enters, target player creates a 1/1 white and black Inkling creature token with flying. Then if an opponent controls more creatures than you, this creature becomes prepared. (While it's prepared, you may cast a copy of its spell. Doing so unprepares it.)\"); sos_57 `ManaSculpt` {1}{U}{U}; sos_97 `RalZarekGuestLecturer` {1}{B}{B} Legendary Planeswalker—Ral loyalty 3 (\"+1: Surveil 2.\\n−1: Any number of target players each discard a card.\\n−2: Return target creature card with mana value 3 or less from your graveyard to the battlefield.\\n−7: Flip five coins. Target opponent skips their next X turns, where X is the number of coins that came up heads.\"); sos_120 `ImprovisationCapstone` {5}{R}{R} Sorcery—Lesson Paradigm (\"Exile cards from the top of your library until you exile cards with total mana value 4 or greater. You may cast any number of spells from among them without paying their mana costs.\\nParadigm (Then exile this spell. After you first resolve a spell with this name, you may cast a copy of it from exile without paying its mana cost at the beginning of each of your first main phases.)\"); sos_201 `LoreholdTheHistorian` {3}{R}{W} Elder Dragon 5/5 Flying+Haste (\"Flying, haste\\nEach instant and sorcery card in your hand has miracle {2}.\\nAt the beginning of each opponent's upkeep, you may discard a card. If you do, draw a card.\"); sos_226 `SilverquillTheDisputant` {2}{W}{B}; sos_245 `WitherbloomTheBalancer` {6}{B}{G}; sos_257 `GreatHallOfTheBiblioplex` Land (empty mana_cost: \"{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}, Pay 1 life: Add one mana of any color. Spend this mana only to cast an instant or sorcery spell.\\n{5}: If this land isn't a creature, it becomes a 2/4 Wizard creature with \\\"Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, this creature gets +1/+0 until end of turn.\\\" It's still a land.\").\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n   - **`/workspace/engine/casting.py`** (MODIFIED): Top imports include `from engine.events import SpellCastTriggeredEvent`. After payment: `card.mana_spent = effective_cost.cmc`. Both cast_spell and cast_spell_free fire `SpellCastTriggeredEvent(spell=stack_obj, player=player, card=card, controller=player)` after pushing. `_resolve_spell` else-branch uses `dest = (Zone.EXILE if getattr(card, \"_exile_instead_of_graveyard\", False) else Zone.GRAVEYARD)`. **NEW THIS SESSION:** `get_cost_reduction` now scans battlefield permanents after computing card's own reduction:\n     ```python\n     for player in game.players:\n         for permanent in player.zones[Zone.BATTLEFIELD].get_all():\n             if permanent is card:\n                 continue\n             hook = getattr(permanent, \"spell_cost_reduction\", None)\n             if hook is not None:\n                 raw += hook(game, card, controller)\n     ```\n   - **`/workspace/engine/card.py`** (MODIFIED THIS SESSION): Added default method to `CardImpl` (after `cost_reduction`):\n     ```python\n     def spell_cost_reduction(self, game, card, controller) -> int:\n         \"\"\"Extra generic reduction this permanent grants to another spell.\"\"\"\n         return 0\n     ```\n   - **`/workspace/engine/combat.py`** (MODIFIED previously): declare_attackers_step fires `AttacksTriggeredEvent(creature=attacker, attacker=attacker)` for each attacker.\n   - **`/workspace/engine/events.py`** (MODIFIED previously): `BeginningOfUpkeepTriggeredEvent` has `player: Any = None`. Added `BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent(TriggeredEvent)` with `player: Any = None`, `phase: Any = None`. `AttacksTriggeredEvent` has `creature`/`attacker`. `SpellCastTriggeredEvent` has `spell/player/card/controller`.\n   - **`/workspace/engine/turn.py`** (MODIFIED previously): Upkeep fires `BeginningOfUpkeepTriggeredEvent(player=game.active_player)`. Main phases fire `BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent(player=game.active_player, phase=game.phase)`.\n   - **`/workspace/engine/stack.py`** (MODIFIED previously): Has `Stack.remove(obj)` (identity-based, returns bool). `copy_spell(game, original, controller, new_targets=None)` shallow-copies source, `_copy_resolve` sets chosen_targets + calls on_resolve (no zone move).\n   - **`/workspace/cards/sos/sos_226/card_impl.py`** (DONE): SilverquillTheDisputant(Creature), casualty via SpellCastTriggeredEvent trigger.