{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   Implement 10 SOS Magic: The Gathering card implementations in `/workspace/cards/sos/`: cards 1, 4, 13, 57, 97, 120, 201, 226, 245, 257. Each card directory (`cards/sos/sos_<N>/`) contains a `card_spec.json` (metadata) and a `card_impl.py` template (stub class) to fill in. Use completed FDN cards in `/workspace/cards/fdn/` as examples, refer to `RULEBOOK.txt`, and read engine source modules directly for API discovery. The user stated: \"You are expected to make changes to the engine to implement new keywords and mechanics. The existing code base may not be perfect, you are free to make changes that don't break current behavior.\"\n\n   CRITICAL CONSTRAINT (verbatim): \"Do not modify any files under workspace/engine_tests/. These tests are staged for your local verification only; the runner uses its own authoritative copies for grading. Modifying the workspace tests will not change your score — it will only mislead you about whether your engine changes are correct.\"\n\n   Per-card tests go at `cards/sos/sos_<N>/tests.py` (I create these). Do NOT modify FDN tests. Engine modifications must be additive/behavior-preserving. The engine_tests baseline is 1145 passed (must stay 1145).\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - MTG mechanics: Casualty (sos_226 ✓), Counter+delayed-mana (sos_57 ✓), Converge (sos_4 ✓), graveyard-cost-reduction + attack-cast-from-graveyard (sos_1 ✓), Affinity self+granting (sos_245 ✓), land mana abilities + {5}-animation-to-creature (sos_257 ✓ this session), Preparation/Prepared mechanic + token-maker (sos_13 in progress), Paradigm (sos_120), Miracle granter + loot (sos_201), Planeswalker (sos_97).\n   - Engine identifies CREATURES in combat via `hasattr(c, \"base_power\")` (combat.py:228,300) and in SBA via `hasattr(obj, \"toughness\")` (state_based_actions.py:101,121). CRITICAL: a Land that can become a creature must NOT expose these until animated, or it's wrongly treated as a creature.\n   - Creature: `power` property = `modified_power + plus_one_counters - minus_one_counters`; `_reset_characteristics()` (called by EffectManager.apply_all) resets card_types to `_original_card_types`, keywords, and (for Creature) modified_power/toughness/counters to base. card_types is reset by apply_all; subtypes are NOT reset.\n   - ManaAbility(cost, mana_produced, description): cost(game, source)->bool (taps/pays, returns success); mana_produced(game)->None (adds to source.controller.mana_pool). Mana abilities resolve immediately. ActivatedAbility(cost, effect, description): cost(game,source)->bool, effect(game)->None.\n   - ManaPool: `can_pay(cost)`, `pay(cost)`, `add(ManaType, n)`, `get(ManaType)`, `total()`. ManaCost(generic=5) or ManaCost.parse(\"{W}\").\n   - ContinuousEffect(source, layer, sublayer, apply, timestamp, duration). Layer.POWER_TOUGHNESS, SubLayer.MODIFY_PT/SET_PT, DURATION_END_OF_TURN=0, DURATION_PERMANENT=-1. EffectManager.add/remove_expired/apply_all (reset-then-reapply, idempotent). apply_all/remove_expired only called in turn.py cleanup.\n   - TriggerManager.register(TriggerRegistration(event_type, condition, effect, source, controller)), unregister(source identity), fire_event(game, event). Condition (game,event)->bool; effect (game)->None (capture via closure). isinstance filters before condition; APNAP ordering.\n   - cast_spell(game, player, card): HAND-ONLY (step 3 hand check), charges mana, applies cost_reduction via get_cost_reduction. cast_spell_free(game, player, card, from_zone): works from ANY zone incl Zone.EXILE, NO mana charge, handles targeting via get_targets/choose_target, pushes StackObject, fires SpellCastTriggeredEvent. _resolve_spell sets card.chosen_targets from stack_obj.targets, moves permanents→battlefield, instants/sorceries→graveyard (or EXILE if `_exile_instead_of_graveyard` flag).\n   - move_to_zone (zones.py:179): when ENTERING battlefield, fires EntersBattlefieldTriggeredEvent(permanent, controller) BEFORE calling card.register_triggers — so a card's OWN self-ETB trigger does NOT fire from its own entry. Convention: tests manually call `card.register_triggers(game)` then `fire_event(EntersBattlefieldTriggeredEvent(permanent=card, controller=p))`.\n   - create_token(game, player, token): sets is_token=True, adds to battlefield, fires ETB. game.exile(game, obj) moves obj to owner's EXILE from any zone.\n   - Tokens: SBA `_sba_token_not_on_battlefield` removes tokens (is_token=True) from non-battlefield zones (so a cast copy with is_token=True ceases to exist after going to graveyard).\n   - DeterministicPlayer scripted via `_script` deque; choose/choose_yes_no/choose_target/choose_card all _pop() (popleft).\n   - Keyword Flag enum (types.py:97) has NO PREPARED or MIRACLE; only evergreen keywords (FLYING, DEATHTOUCH, FLASH, etc.). ManaType enum: WHITE=\"W\", BLUE=\"U\", BLACK=\"B\", RED=\"R\", GREEN=\"G\", COLORLESS=\"C\".\n   - Python 3.11; run with bare `pytest` (NOT `python` — not installed; `python -m pytest` also fails). \"Unknown config option: timeout\" warning harmless.\n   - Card loading convention: tests import class directly (e.g. `from cards.sos.sos_245.card_impl import WitherbloomTheBalancer`); NO module-level `register()` function in card_impl files.\n   - Oracle texts/class names: sos_13 `EmeritusOfTruceSwordsToPlowshares` (spec name \"Emeritus of Truce // Swords to Plowshares\", \"{1}{W}{W} // {W}\", \"Creature — Cat Cleric // Instant\", 3/3, colors [W], keywords [Prepared]; ETB: \"When this creature enters, target player creates a 1/1 white and black Inkling creature token with flying. Then if an opponent controls more creatures than you, this creature becomes prepared. (While it's prepared, you may cast a copy of its spell. Doing so unprepares it.)\"). sos_257 `GreatHallOfTheBiblioplex` (Land, empty cost). sos_120 `ImprovisationCapstone` {5}{R}{R} Sorcery (Paradigm). sos_201 `LoreholdTheHistorian` {3}{R}{W} (Miracle granter). sos_97 `RalZarekGuestLecturer` {1}{B}{B} planeswalker.\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n   - `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_257/card_impl.py` (CREATED THIS SESSION, COMPLETE, 14 tests pass): GreatHallOfTheBiblioplex(Land). Key design: exposes NO creature characteristics until animated.\n     ```python\n     from engine.card import ActivatedAbility, Land, ManaAbility\n     from engine.continuous_effects import (ContinuousEffect, DURATION_END_OF_TURN, Layer, SubLayer)\n     from engine.events import SpellCastTriggeredEvent\n     from engine.triggers import TriggerRegistration\n     from engine.types import CardType, ManaCost, ManaType, Zone\n\n     _ANY_COLOR = (ManaType.WHITE, ManaType.BLUE, ManaType.BLACK, ManaType.RED, ManaType.GREEN)\n     def _on_battlefield(game, obj): ... # iterate players, check BATTLEFIELD contains\n     def _is_instant_or_sorcery(card): types=getattr(card,\"card_types\",set()); return CardType.INSTANT in types or CardType.SORCERY in types\n\n     class GreatHallOfTheBiblioplex(Land):\n         def __init__(self, **kwargs):\n             kwargs.setdefault(\"name\", \"Great Hall of the Biblioplex\")\n             kwargs.setdefault(\"mana_cost\", ManaCost())\n             kwargs.setdefault(\"rules_text\", \"...\")\n             super().__init__(**kwargs)\n             self.colors = []\n             self._animated = False\n             self._pump_trigger_registered = False\n         @property\n         def power(self):\n             if not self._animated: raise AttributeError(\"power\")\n             return self.modified_power + self.plus_one_counters - self.minus_one_counters\n         @property\n         def toughness(self):\n             if not self._animated: raise AttributeError(\"toughness\")\n             return self.modified_toughness + self.plus_one_counters - self.minus_one_counters\n         def _reset_characteristics(self):\n             super()._reset_characteristics()\n             if self._animated:\n                 self.card_types.add(CardType.CREATURE); self.subtypes.add(\"Wizard\")\n                 self.modified_power = self.base_power; self.modified_toughness = self.base_toughness\n                 self.plus_one_counters = self._base_plus_one_counters; self.minus_one_counters = self._base_minus_one_counters\n         def get_mana_abilities(self):\n             # _tap (untapped check + tap) -> _add_colorless (COLORLESS+1)\n             # _tap_pay_life (untapped + life>=1 -> tap, life-=1) -> _add_any_color (controller.choose(list(_ANY_COLOR),...), add chosen)\n             return [ManaAbility(cost=_tap, mana_produced=_add_colorless, description=\"{T}: Add {C}.\"),\n                     ManaAbility(cost=_tap_pay_life, mana_produced=_add_any_color, description=\"{T}, Pay 1 life: ...\")]\n         def get_activated_abilities(self):\n             # _cost: controller.mana_pool.can_pay(ManaCost(generic=5)) then pay; _effect: source._animate(game)\n             return [ActivatedAbility(cost=_cost, effect=_effect, description=\"{5}: ...\")]\n         def _animate(self, game):\n             if self._animated or CardType.CREATURE in self.card_types: return\n             self._animated = True\n             self.base_power=2; self.base_toughness=4; self.modified_power=2; self.modified_toughness=4\n             self.plus_one_counters=0; self.minus_one_counters=0; self._base_plus_one_counters=0; self._base_minus_one_counters=0\n             self.damage_marked=0; self.summoning_sick=False; self.is_attacking=False; self.is_blocking=False; self.dealt_deathtouch_damage=False\n             self.card_types.add(CardType.CREATURE); self.subtypes.add(\"Wizard\")\n             self._register_pump_trigger(game)\n         def _register_pump_trigger(self, game):\n             # guard via _pump_trigger_registered; register SpellCastTriggeredEvent trigger\n             # condition: _animated, CREATURE in card_types, on battlefield, event.controller is self.controller, _is_instant_or_sorcery(event.card)\n             # effect: add ContinuousEffect(POWER_TOUGHNESS, MODIFY_PT, apply=lambda g: source.modified_power+=1, duration=DURATION_END_OF_TURN) then game.effect_manager.apply_all(game)\n     ```\n   - `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_257/tests.py` (CREATED THIS SESSION, 14 tests pass): classes TestGreatHallProperties (name; is_land_with_no_mana_cost; not_a_creature_initially asserts `not hasattr(hall,\"base_power\")`, `not hasattr(hall,\"power\")`), TestGreatHallManaAbilities (tap_for_colorless; tapped_cannot_tap_again; pay_life_for_any_color scripts [ManaType.BLUE], life 20→19; pay_life_blocked_at_zero_life), TestGreatHallAnimation (_setup gives mana={COLORLESS:5}; five_mana_animates; idempotent (1 trigger); survives_effect_recalculation via apply_all; cast_trigger_pumps_power via `_fire_cast` helper that fires SpellCastTriggeredEvent then resolves stack; pump_only_for_instant_or_sorcery; no_pump_before_animation; pump_expires_at_cleanup via remove_expired+apply_all). Helper `_fire_cast(game, player, spell)` fires SpellCastTriggeredEvent(spell=spell, player=player, card=spell, controller=player) then pops+resolves stack.\n   - `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_13/card_spec.json` (READ): name \"Emeritus of Truce // Swords to Plowshares\", mana_cost \"{1}{W}{W} // {W}\", type_line \"Creature — Cat Cleric // Instant\", power \"3\", toughness \"3\", colors [\"W\"], keywords [\"Prepared\"], complexity_tier \"complex\".\n   - `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_13/card_impl.py` (STUB, NOT STARTED): `class EmeritusOfTruceSwordsToPlowshares(CardImpl): pass`.\n   - `/workspace/engine/casting.py` (read; MODIFIED in prior session): cast_spell (hand-only), cast_spell_free (any zone, no mana charge), _resolve_spell (chosen_targets, _exile_instead_of_graveyard flag), get_cost_reduction (scans battlefield permanents' spell_cost_reduction). N