set to base then add +1 per effect). Verified 54 cards/sos tests pass.\n   - sos_13 design (in progress): Since cast_spell is hand-only, the prepared STP copy will be cast by paying {W} manually then calling cast_spell_free(game, controller, copy, Zone.EXILE). The copy is a token-like Instant (is_token=True) so it ceases to exist after resolution. ETB trigger tested by manual register_triggers + fire_event per established convention. Considering adding Keyword.PREPARED to the enum (additive, sanctioned) and re-verifying engine_tests=1145.\n\n6. All user messages:\n   - \"Tool loaded.\" (after ToolSearch for TaskList,TaskUpdate).\n   - The recurring system-reminder about task tools (not a real user message; lists tasks #1-12).\n   - Final message: \"CRITICAL: Respond with TEXT ONLY. Do NOT call any tools... Your task is to create a detailed summary of the conversation so far...\" (the summarization request).\n   - (No new substantive user instructions beyond the original task; security/process constraints carried from prior summary: do not modify engine_tests; engine changes must be additive/behavior-preserving.)\n\n7. Pending Tasks:\n   - #8 [in_progress] Implement sos_13 Emeritus of Truce (Prepared/Preparation-card mechanic)\n   - #9 Implement sos_120 Improvisation Capstone (Paradigm)\n   - #10 Implement sos_201 Lorehold (Miracle)\n   - #11 Implement sos_97 Ral Zarek planeswalker\n   - #12 Write tests and run full suite (`pytest engine_tests/ cards/ -q`; confirm engine_tests stay at 1145)\n\n8. Current Work:\n   Implementing sos_13 (Emeritus of Truce // Swords to Plowshares, task #8 in_progress). Completed all research/API discovery: read card_spec.json, RULEBOOK rule 722 (Preparation Cards mechanic), cast_spell (hand-only), cast_spell_free (any zone, no mana), move_to_zone (ETB-before-register ordering), game.py create_token/exile, fdn_98 ETB pattern, and confirmed via engine_tests/test_triggers.py the ETB test convention (\"card enters battlefield → register_triggers → fire event → StackObject\"). Confirmed no Keyword.PREPARED exists in the enum. The design plan: \n   - `EmeritusOfTruceSwordsToPlowshares(Creature)`: name=\"Emeritus of Truce // Swords to Plowshares\", mana_cost {1}{W}{W}, subtypes {Cat, Cleric}, base_power=3/base_toughness=3, colors [\"W\"], keyword PREPARED (after adding to enum), self.prepared=False, self._stp_copy=None.\n   - register_triggers: EntersBattlefieldTriggeredEvent, condition `event.permanent is source`; effect chooses target player (controller.choose(list(game.players))), creates Inkling token (Creature 1/1 W/B FLYING, subtypes {\"Inkling\"}) via create_token, then if any opponent controls more creatures than controller → call _become_prepared.\n   - _become_prepared(game): if already prepared return; create _SwordsToPlowshares copy in controller's EXILE, set prepared=True, store self._stp_copy.\n   - cast_prepared(game): require prepared + copy; pay {W} via controller.mana_pool; set prepared=False; cast_spell_free(game, controller, copy, Zone.EXILE).\n   - _SwordsToPlowshares(Instant): name \"Swords to Plowshares\", {W}, colors [\"W\"], is_token=True; get_targets returns TargetRequirement (CREATURE on battlefield); on_resolve exiles target (engine.game.exile) and target's controller gains life equal to target's power (compute before exile; controller.life += power + fire GainsLifeTriggeredEvent).\n   No code has been written for sos_13 yet — only the stub exists.\n\n9. Optional Next Step:\n   Write `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_13/card_impl.py` implementing the Preparation-card mechanic per the design above. First add `PREPARED = enum.auto()` to the Keyword Flag enum in `/workspace/engine/types.py` (additive change), then write the card with `EmeritusOfTruceSwordsToPlowshares(Creature)` (front face + ETB token/prepare trigger + cast_prepared helper) and the `_SwordsToPlowshares(Instant)` prepare-spell copy. Then write `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_13/tests.py` (properties; ETB creates Inkling token f