e/engine/mana.py-75-        Hybrid symbols can be paid with either option; this method uses\n/workspace/engine/mana.py-76-        backtracking to find a valid assignment.\n/workspace/engine/mana.py-77-\nengine/mana.py-78-        Returns:\n--\nengine/mana.py:98:    def pay(self, cost: ManaCost, choices: dict[ManaType, int] | None = None) -> bool:\n/workspace/engine/mana.py-99-        \"\"\"Deduct mana from the pool to pay *cost*.\n/workspace/engine/mana.py-100-\nengine/mana.py-101-        Parameters:\nengine/mana.py-102-            cost: The mana cost to pay.\nengine/mana.py-103-            choices: How to split the generic portion across mana types.\nengine/mana.py-104-                If ``None``, auto-pay greedily: pay colored pips first,\n/workspace/engine/mana.py-105-                then hybrid symbols, then generic using colorless first,\n/workspace/engine/mana.py-106-                then excess colored."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b76fbb6d-7052-44e0-893e-8a2c1cc9d4a6","uuid":"9bd5a495-a2c7-48de-b018-c3d4a4ff513f","timestamp":"2026-05-30T05:15:06.258Z","tool_use_result":{"mode":"content","numFiles":0,"filenames":[],"content":"engine/player.py:40:    def choose_target(self, options: Any, requirement: Any) -> Any:\n/workspace/engine/player.py-41-        \"\"\"Choose a target from the available options given a requirement.\n/workspace/engine/player.py-42-\nengine/player.py-43-        Parameters:\nengine/player.py-44-            options: The available targets to choose from.\nengine/player.py-45-            requirement: The targeting requirement to satisfy.\n/workspace/engine/player.py-46-\nengine/player.py-47-        Returns:\n/workspace/engine/player.py-48-            The chosen target.\n--\nengine/player.py:52:    def choose(self, options: Any, description: str) -> Any:\n/workspace/engine/player.py-53-        \"\"\"Choose from a list of options.\n/workspace/engine/player.py-54-\nengine/player.py-55-        Parameters:\nengine/player.py-56-        