{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   Implement 10 SOS Magic: The Gathering card implementations in `/workspace/cards/sos/`: cards 1, 4, 13, 57, 97, 120, 201, 226, 245, 257. Each card directory (`cards/sos/sos_<N>/`) contains a `card_spec.json` (metadata) and a `card_impl.py` template stub to fill in. Use completed FDN cards in `/workspace/cards/fdn/` as examples, refer to `RULEBOOK.txt`, and read engine source modules directly for API discovery. The user stated: \"You are expected to make changes to the engine to implement new keywords and mechanics. The existing code base may not be perfect, you are free to make changes that don't break current behavior.\" Per-card tests go at `cards/sos/sos_<N>/tests.py` (I create these). Engine modifications must be additive/behavior-preserving; the engine_tests baseline of 1145 passed must stay 1145.\n\n   CRITICAL CONSTRAINT (verbatim): \"Do not modify any files under workspace/engine_tests/. These tests are staged for your local verification only; the runner uses its own authoritative copies for grading. Modifying the workspace tests will not change your score — it will only mislead you about whether your engine changes are correct.\"\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - MTG mechanics implemented this session: Miracle granter + opponent-upkeep loot (sos_201 Lorehold), Planeswalker with four loyalty abilities incl. Surveil, multi-target discard, reanimation, coin-flip + skip-turns (sos_97 Ral Zarek). Earlier cards covered Casualty, Counter+delayed-mana, Converge, graveyard-recast, Affinity, land-animation, Preparation/Prepared, Paradigm.\n   - Planeswalker model (engine/card.py): `Planeswalker(CardImpl)` __init__(starting_loyalty=0, **kwargs) adds CardType.PLANESWALKER, sets self.starting_loyalty and self.loyalty. `get_loyalty_abilities() -> list[LoyaltyAbility]` (override per card). `LoyaltyAbility` dataclass: fields `loyalty_cost: int`, `effect: Callable[..., Any]`, `description: str=\"\"`.\n   - Loyalty activation (engine/abilities.py): `LoyaltyAbilityInstance(source, controller, loyalty_cost=0, effect=lambda g: None, description=\"\")`. `activate_ability(game, player, instance)` dispatches to `_activate_loyalty_ability`, which: (1) requires sorcery-speed timing (player is active, main phase, empty stack); (2) enforces once-per-turn via module-level tracker (`clear_loyalty_tracking()` resets it; tests use an autouse fixture); (3) checks `current_loyalty + loyalty_cost >= 0` else AbilityError; (4) sets source.loyalty; (5) pushes `StackObject(source, controller, on_resolve=ability.effect, is_mana_ability=False)`. The effect signature is `(game) -> None`.\n   - Casting (engine/casting.py): `cast_spell` is HAND-ONLY, charges mana. `cast_spell_free(game, player, card, from_zone)` works from any zone, NO mana charge, calls card.get_targets then choose_target per spec, pushes StackObject with on_resolve=_resolve_spell, fires SpellCastTriggeredEvent. `_resolve_spell` sets card.chosen_targets, calls on_resolve, routes permanents→battlefield, instant/sorcery→graveyard (or EXILE if `card._exile_instead_of_graveyard`).\n   - Triggers (engine/triggers.py): `fire_event` evaluates each trigger's `condition(game, event)` (filtered by isinstance of event_type), then PUSHES matching triggers as StackObjects in APNAP order — it does NOT resolve inline. Effect receives only `(game)`; pass event data via the mutable-cell pattern (set a list cell in condition, read in effect).\n   - Events (engine/events.py): DrawsCardTriggeredEvent(player, card), BeginningOfUpkeepTriggeredEvent(player), BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent(player, phase), EntersBattlefieldTriggeredEvent(permanent, controller), GainsLifeTriggeredEvent(player, amount), SpellCastTriggeredEvent(spell, player, card, controller).\n   - draw_card (engine/game.py:294): if library empty, sets drawn_from_empty_library and returns None BEFORE incrementing; otherwise removes top (library.top(1)[0]), adds to hand, increments cards_drawn_this_turn (sets to 0 if missing), fires DrawsCardTriggeredEvent. discard(game, player, card) moves hand→graveyard. move_to_zone(game, card, from, to) (zones.py) fires ETB before register_triggers; for graveyard→battlefield uses owner as source player and controller as dest player.\n   - Surveil convention (fdn_28): top card = library.get_all()[-1]; choose_yes_no per card to put into graveyard, else keep on top.\n   - DeterministicPlayer: `_script` deque, all choose_* and now flip_coin call `_pop()` (popleft). Construct via `create_game(scripts=([...],[...]))`; append more via `player._script.append(x)`.\n   - test_utils: `create_game(scripts=...)`, `set_board_state(game, idx, battlefield=, hand=, graveyard=, life=, mana=)` (NO library param — set library directly). create_game with empty decks resets drawn_from_empty_library and leaves cards_drawn_this_turn unset/0 (draw_card returns early on empty library).\n   - Registry (cards/registry.py): manual `register()`-based; `create_instance(name, owner)` calls `impl_class(name=name, owner=owner)` (no controller). Cards must accept name+owner kwargs and handle controller=None.\n   - Environment: Python is invoked as `python3` (bare `python` is NOT available — exit 127). Run tests with bare `pytest`. \"Unknown config option: timeout\" warning is harmless.\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n   - `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_201/card_impl.py` (written prior, verified this session; LoreholdTheHistorian(Creature)):\n      - {3}{R}{W}, subtypes {Elder, Dragon}, Supertype.LEGENDARY, keywords Keyword.FLYING|Keyword.HASTE, base_power=5, base_toughness=5, colors=[\"R\",\"W\"]. Module const `_MIRACLE_COST = ManaCost(generic=2)`.\n      - `register_triggers` calls `_register_miracle` and `_register_loot`.\n      - `_register_miracle`: mutable cell `drawn=[None]`; condition on DrawsCardTriggeredEvent checks _on_battlefield(source), event.player is owner, card is instant/sorcery, `owner.cards_drawn_this_turn == 1`, sets drawn[0]; effect casts via pay {2} + cast_spell_free(from HAND) if can_pay and choose_yes_no.\n      - `_register_loot`: condition on BeginningOfUpkeepTriggeredEvent checks on_battlefield + upkeep_player is not owner; effect: if hand non-empty and choose_yes_no, choose_card to discard then draw_card.\n   - `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_201/tests.py` (CREATED, 18 tests pass): helpers _lorehold, _instant, _sorcery, _creature, _set_library (last item = top), _resolve_stack (pop/on_resolve/resolve_state_based_actions). TestLoreholdProperties (name, mana_cost, power_toughness, types_and_subtypes, legendary, keywords, colors). TestMiracle with `_setup(game, p1, *, drawn_before=0, mana=2)` (mana_dict={RED:mana} if mana>0 else {}, register_triggers, sets cards_drawn_this_turn=drawn_before): first_drawn_instant_can_be_cast_for_two (asserts bolt not in hand, in graveyard, RED pool==0), sorcery_also_qualifies, declined_miracle_keeps_card_in_hand (RED==2), no_miracle_on_second_draw (drawn_before=1), no_miracle_for_noncastable_type (creature), no_miracle_without_mana (mana=0), no_miracle_when_lorehold_not_on_battlefield (lorehold in hand). TestLoot with `_setup(game, p1, *, hand, library)`: loots_on_opponent_upkeep (p1._script.append(True); append(to_discard); fire BeginningOfUpkeepTriggeredEvent(player=p2); assert to_discard in graveyard, to_draw in hand), no_loot_on_own_upkeep (player=p1), declined_loot_does_nothing, no_loot_with_empty_hand. Loot tests use Creature for drawn card to avoid miracle cross-trigger.\n   - `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_97/card_impl.py` (CREATED, 17 tests pass; RalZarekGuestLecturer(Planeswalker)):\n      ```python\n      _COINS: int = 5\n      def _cmc(card): cost=getattr(card,\"mana_cost\",None); return cost.cmc if cost is not None else 0\n      def _is_creature_card(card): return CardType.CREATURE in getattr(card,\"card_types\",set())\n\n      class RalZarekGuestLecturer(Planeswalker):\n          def __init__(self, **kwargs):\n              kwargs.setdefault(\"name\",\"Ral Zarek, Guest Lecturer\")\n              kwargs.setdefault(\"mana_cost\", ManaCost.parse(\"{1}{B}{B}\"))\n              kwargs.setdefault(\"starting_loyalty\", 3)\n              kwargs[\"supertypes\"]=(kwargs.get(\"supertypes\") or set())|{Supertype.LEGENDARY}\n              kwargs.setdefault(\"subtypes\", {\"Ral\"})\n              kwargs.setdefault(\"rules_text\", \"+1: Surveil 2.\\n...\")\n              super().__init__(**kwargs)\n              self.colors=[\"B\"]\n          def get_loyalty_abilities(self):\n              pw=self\n              return [LoyaltyAbility(+1, lambda game: pw._surveil(game,2), \"+1: Surveil 2.\"),\n                      LoyaltyAbility(-1, pw._each_target_player_discards, \"...\"),\n                      LoyaltyAbility(-2, pw._reanimate_small_creature, \"...\"),\n                      LoyaltyAbility(-7, pw._flip_for_skipped_turns, \"...\")]\n      ```\n      - `_surveil(game, amount)`: iterate `reversed(library.top(amount))`; per card choose_yes_no → move to graveyard else keep.\n      - `_each_target_player_discards(game)`: for each player, controller.choose_yes_no to target; targeted player choose_card then discard(game, player, card).\n      - `_reanimate_small_creature(game)`: candidates = creature cards MV≤3 in controller graveyard; controller.choose_card; move_to_zone(game, card, GRAVEYARD, BATTLEFIELD).\n      - `_flip_for_skipped_turns(game)`: opponents = players != controller; target = sole opponent or controller.choose(...); `heads = sum(1 for _ in range(_COINS) if controller.flip_coin())`; if heads>0 set `target.skipped_turns += heads`.\n   - `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_97/tests.py` (CREATED, 17 tests pass): autouse `_reset_loyalty_tracker` fixture (clear_loyalty_tracking before/after). Helpers _ral, _creature(playe